          "settings": {
            "question": "Where can I buy Kerala spices online?",
            "answer": "<p>Pure Leven Spices & Tea sells whole Kerala spices online: extra bold cardamom, black pepper, white pepper and Adimali cloves from farming families around Idukki, plus Ceylon and cassia cinnamon and star anise. Orders ship across India, usually in 6 to 9 working days, and shipping is free above ₹649. Questions before ordering? WhatsApp +91 88482 65849.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are your spices organic?",
            "answer": "<p>Our cardamom is grown with natural farming practices on our own farm, but neither our cardamom nor our pepper is certified organic. We say so on each product page, so you know exactly what you are buying. Ask us on WhatsApp if you want more detail on a batch.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3": {
