          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you ship outside India?",
            "answer": "<p>No. We deliver only within India, usually in 6 to 9 working days. If you live abroad, you can order for family in India to carry, and our <a href=\"/blogs/cooking-spices/carry-spices-international-flight-india\">guide to carrying spices on an international flight</a> covers packing and customs.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_4": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Which Kerala spice should I buy first?",
            "answer": "<p>Start with cardamom, black pepper and cloves. These three lose their smell over time, so buying whole from close to the farm helps most. Turmeric is not in the shop yet. Tell us what you cook on WhatsApp at +91 88482 65849 and we will suggest a sensible first few.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_5": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do you sell spices in bulk or wholesale?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, for cardamom and black pepper. See <a href=\"/pages/cardamom-wholesale\">cardamom wholesale</a> and <a href=\"/pages/black-pepper-wholesale\">black pepper wholesale</a> for grades and how to order, or check <a href=\"/pages/cardamom-price-today\">today's cardamom price</a>. For other spices, message us on WhatsApp at +91 88482 65849.</p>"
