          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How should I store whole spices?",
            "answer": "<p>In an airtight jar, in a cool, dark cupboard away from the stove. Whole spices keep their smell for months this way; ground spices fade within weeks. Our <a href=\"/blogs/cooking-spices/how-to-store-spices\">spice storage guide</a> has the details.</p>"
